/target
/tools/bindings/target
Cargo.lock
# Pinned so that the bindings are always regenerated by the same version of the generator.
# Its output is formatted by the rustfmt on PATH, at style edition 2024. That formatting
# does not change between rustfmt releases, but a personal rustfmt.toml can still change it.
!/tools/bindings/Cargo.lock
.idea/
*.raw
